---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = "+17044696658";
const phoneDisplay = "+1 (704) 469-6658";
---
<Layout title="Drain Line Cleaning Gastonia NC | AC Condensate Drain | acrepairgastonianc.com" description="AC drain line cleaning in Gastonia, NC. Clear clogs, prevent overflow and mold. Recommended every cooling season. Call +1 (704) 469-6658.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Services / Drain Line Cleaning</p>
      <h1>Drain Line Cleaning in Gastonia, NC</h1>
      <p>Blocked condensate drains are a leading cause of AC water damage. We clear the full path and confirm free drainage.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-white btn-lg">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>Water near your indoor unit is never something to leave until tomorrow. A blocked condensate drain line is one of the most common reasons residential AC systems shut off unexpectedly or allow moisture to accumulate near the air handler.</p>
      <p>We clear the clog, test the full drain path, and confirm the system is draining freely before the visit ends — so the problem doesn't quietly return a few weeks later.</p>
      <h2>Signs Your Drain Line May Be Clogged</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Water pooling or dripping near the indoor unit</li>
        <li>Drain pan full or standing water</li>
        <li>Musty smell near vents or the air handler</li>
        <li>AC shuts off without warning (float switch)</li>
        <li>Indoor humidity feels higher than usual</li>
        <li>Recurring moisture buildup across multiple cycles</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What Causes Drain Line Clogs</h2>
      <p>Algae buildup, moisture sludge, mold growth, debris from filters and coils, and stagnant water left from the off-season all contribute. In Gastonia's humid summers, condensate volume is high — a partial restriction can become a full blockage quickly.</p>
      <div class="cta-box">
        <p>Need drain line cleaning in Gastonia?</p>
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
      </div>
      <p>Related: <a href="/services/emergency-ac-repair/">Emergency AC Repair</a> · <a href="/problems/leaking-water/">Leaking Water</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
